WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:02.930
An elite boy's school.

00:03.100 --> 00:06.070
I transferred after the semester began.

00:06.170 --> 00:08.870
I had no idea what was waiting for me.

00:09.170 --> 00:11.770
I thought it was just a school full of guys...

00:12.010 --> 00:13.310
...but why do I see a girl?

00:13.440 --> 00:14.540
I'm a guy!

00:14.640 --> 00:15.170
Huh?

00:15.280 --> 00:16.510
But that skirt...

00:16.610 --> 00:18.580
What are you saying?
You're going to wear it too.

00:18.680 --> 00:19.150
What?

00:19.250 --> 00:21.440
The three of us are in this together.

00:21.620 --> 00:23.280
Let's do a great job, okay?

00:23.390 --> 00:24.880
No!

00:25.150 --> 00:28.680
And this is how my life as a princess began...

00:30.190 --> 00:36.830
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

00:36.970 --> 00:43.570
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

00:44.470 --> 00:49.540
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

00:49.680 --> 00:56.240
<i>I always have them</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

00:57.220 --> 01:01.920
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

01:02.160 --> 01:07.600
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

01:09.900 --> 01:15.570
<i>Sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

01:15.670 --> 01:22.480
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like the wind.</i>

01:22.610 --> 01:29.280
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:29.380 --> 01:35.090
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:35.290 --> 01:41.960
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say...</i>

01:42.100 --> 01:47.760
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

01:48.070 --> 01:58.070
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:00.380 --> 02:05.840
<i>The Princesses' Existence in Danger</i>

02:07.290 --> 02:12.460
<i>Fujimori Academy 2007</i>

02:23.340 --> 02:25.600
Fujimori Academy...

02:26.380 --> 02:31.250
<i>Fujimori Academy 2007</i>

02:45.060 --> 02:49.500
I thought you felt the same way about me, that you would always love me.

02:49.600 --> 02:54.470
And if we get married, we can be a real family along with my parents.

02:54.600 --> 02:57.940
An orphan like you should be real happy with this.

02:58.940 --> 03:02.380
So Sayaka went back home?

03:02.510 --> 03:05.040
Yeah, sorry about that Tohru.

03:05.210 --> 03:08.180
I'll make sure to keep an eye on her.

03:09.150 --> 03:11.750
I know it's weird to say this kind of thing to you...

03:11.990 --> 03:14.390
...but Sayaka is serious about you.

03:14.590 --> 03:17.860
That doesn't mean what she did was right.

03:18.260 --> 03:21.250
But try to forgive her.

03:21.700 --> 03:25.160
Yes uncle, I know.

03:31.610 --> 03:34.470
What's wrong with princess Tohru today?

03:34.810 --> 03:36.900
I also like it when he looks worried...

03:37.050 --> 03:39.510
Yeah, it's like...

03:40.750 --> 03:43.120
You think you can fool me like that?

03:43.250 --> 03:45.690
I'm serious.

03:47.620 --> 03:49.420
You want some proof?

04:12.680 --> 04:14.310
You're so stupid, Yujirou!

04:14.450 --> 04:16.610
Why did you have to do that?

04:20.260 --> 04:21.660
I wonder where he went.

04:22.920 --> 04:25.790
I see, that's what happened?

04:25.960 --> 04:28.060
No wonder Tohru's feeling down.

04:28.160 --> 04:31.290
We took care of that girl
Sayaka for the time being...

04:31.400 --> 04:33.270
...but we don't know when she'll be back.

04:33.400 --> 04:35.840
What can we do?

04:35.940 --> 04:39.310
Kouno said not to worry, but we're worried.

04:39.440 --> 04:42.900
Maybe you can think of something, Mr. Sakamoto.

04:43.250 --> 04:46.650
You two really care about Tohru, right?

04:47.020 --> 04:47.980
Huh?

04:48.350 --> 04:50.150
You're worried about him, right?

04:50.250 --> 04:51.720
Friends are great, aren't they?

04:52.120 --> 04:53.450
No!

04:53.560 --> 04:55.650
I was just worried that if
Kouno's concentration faulters...

04:55.760 --> 04:57.920
...there'll be a heavy burden placed on me!

04:58.060 --> 04:59.790
You're right.

04:59.900 --> 05:03.890
Our job is to provide happiness to others.

05:04.030 --> 05:07.260
I guess you're now fully aware of your job as a princess.

05:07.700 --> 05:09.360
I don't want to be fully aware of my duties!

05:09.470 --> 05:13.570
Anyway, I think it's important to watch over Tohru for now.

05:14.080 --> 05:16.100
It seems like he doesn't want to talk about it.

05:16.410 --> 05:21.440
We should listen when he decides to talk about it.

05:22.920 --> 05:24.110
Really?

05:24.690 --> 05:25.450
Yeah.

05:25.650 --> 05:29.560
He probably feels secure with friends like you two.

05:29.720 --> 05:32.960
What are you talking about?
You're his friend too, Akira.

05:33.230 --> 05:34.030
What?

05:34.700 --> 05:35.530
Right!

05:37.130 --> 05:38.760
This is where you guys were?

05:38.870 --> 05:39.890
Tohru?

05:40.240 --> 05:42.170
What are you guys doing here?

05:42.540 --> 05:46.170
I bumped into them when I came here to take a break from my princess job.

05:46.270 --> 05:48.330
Then I saw these two here.

05:48.480 --> 05:51.170
That's right, I was running away from the students.

05:51.310 --> 05:53.180
I came here to take my mind off of things.

05:53.450 --> 05:54.610
I see.

05:55.420 --> 05:57.350
Anyway, let's get to work.

06:00.820 --> 06:03.720
<i>Home economics room</i>

06:07.460 --> 06:09.490
We look good today too!

06:09.660 --> 06:11.900
Let's go Tohru-ko chan!

06:12.030 --> 06:14.200
Yes, Yu-ko chan!

06:15.140 --> 06:17.000
Stop doing that you two!

06:17.110 --> 06:18.160
Hey, princesses!

06:20.840 --> 06:22.780
You look beautiful!

06:22.880 --> 06:24.940
You look beautiful as always!

06:25.050 --> 06:27.020
I'm glad I used this frilly material!

06:27.120 --> 06:29.850
I was also particular about the colors too!
Don't you just love this fine gradation?

06:29.990 --> 06:31.780
It's like this every time...

06:31.890 --> 06:32.980
Give us a break.

06:33.290 --> 06:35.120
That's enough, Natasho!

06:35.690 --> 06:36.850
What are you doing?

06:37.030 --> 06:38.580
Go now princesses!

06:38.760 --> 06:40.020
Thank you very much!

06:40.360 --> 06:42.190
W-Wait!

06:42.300 --> 06:44.460
My greatest masterpiece!

06:51.540 --> 06:53.340
Good luck!

06:53.580 --> 06:54.670
Yeah!

06:56.680 --> 07:00.840
I can't believe how much passion
Natasho has for wardrobes.

07:00.950 --> 07:04.150
He's only interested in wardrobes.

07:04.250 --> 07:06.920
How does he come up with things like this?

07:08.490 --> 07:10.550
Nice shot!

07:14.400 --> 07:15.920
Kouno seems to be acting normal.

07:16.060 --> 07:18.970
He forgets about his sorrow when he's working.

07:24.270 --> 07:25.800
President Arisada?

07:25.940 --> 07:27.530
I wonder where he's going.

07:39.520 --> 07:41.110
Welcome, Director Ryuzaki.

07:41.220 --> 07:43.990
I'm Arisada, the president of the student organization.

07:44.160 --> 07:46.790
I was appointed as your guide by the principal.

07:47.060 --> 07:48.890
Thanks, I appreciate it.

07:49.030 --> 07:52.590
I took over this job from my father who just retired.

07:52.830 --> 07:54.530
There are many things that
I'm still not familiar with.

08:01.410 --> 08:10.550
My father said this is a wonderful school, but I wanted to see it for myself.

08:11.120 --> 08:14.110
Now could you show me around?

08:17.760 --> 08:19.820
Ah, they came at the right time.

08:20.000 --> 08:22.520
Kouno, Shihoudani, Yutaka.

08:22.730 --> 08:23.860
Can you come here for a second?

08:27.470 --> 08:29.300
Where do you think you're going, Mikoto?

08:29.400 --> 08:31.600
President Arisada is calling for you.

08:31.810 --> 08:35.110
But I can't let some stranger see me like this!

08:35.210 --> 08:37.170
Let me go!

08:35.440 --> 08:37.170
<i>Stop running away!</i>

08:37.310 --> 08:40.650
Can you imagine what president
Arisada would say if you fled?

08:41.350 --> 08:43.010
What is it, president Arisada?

08:43.490 --> 08:45.150
Thank you for a job well done.

08:45.250 --> 08:46.450
What is going on?

08:46.920 --> 08:49.020
Girls at an all boys' school?

08:49.220 --> 08:50.780
Plus they're dressed like...

09:00.740 --> 09:02.970
Let me go!

09:03.410 --> 09:04.630
They're boys?

09:04.810 --> 09:07.240
They're our wonderful princesses.

09:10.350 --> 09:11.310
Please.

09:15.420 --> 09:16.890
Unbelievable...

09:17.350 --> 09:19.790
Are they really students from this school?

09:19.920 --> 09:21.820
We're definitely guys!

09:22.290 --> 09:26.090
It might be difficult for him to believe all this.

09:30.430 --> 09:33.300
Didn't the previous director tell you about it?

09:33.740 --> 09:35.670
My father never told me.

09:37.140 --> 09:39.660
He said there's a wonderful treasure at this school.

09:39.770 --> 09:42.970
He said I'd like it if I see it.

09:44.380 --> 09:45.610
Could this be it?

09:45.880 --> 09:48.440
They're valuable treasures for sure.

09:48.620 --> 09:51.480
I hope you like them.

09:53.220 --> 09:54.990
This is absurd...

10:00.330 --> 10:02.920
You dress them up as girls, then call them princesses...

10:03.030 --> 10:05.560
...and you make them participate in certain events?

10:05.700 --> 10:09.970
I can't believe a prestigious school like this would have this stupid system!

10:11.610 --> 10:14.870
You guys are being forced to wear things like that...

10:15.010 --> 10:16.030
I'm sorry.

10:16.140 --> 10:18.610
I'll call a meeting of the committee right away to put an end to all this!

10:18.910 --> 10:19.470
What?

10:20.250 --> 10:20.840
Ouch!

10:20.950 --> 10:21.750
What are you doing?

10:21.850 --> 10:27.120
We're not being forced to do this, right, Tohru?

10:27.260 --> 10:29.160
What? Um, yeah...

10:32.930 --> 10:36.190
I can't believe they can get away with this...

10:42.970 --> 10:46.460
The princess system has been a long-established tradition for this school.

10:46.670 --> 10:49.410
Aren't you being a bit too hasty by saying it's absurd...

10:49.510 --> 10:52.280
...when you know nothing about our system?

10:52.410 --> 10:53.280
It's just...

10:53.550 --> 10:57.780
I'm glad that I was a princess once.

10:57.950 --> 11:00.010
I was able to experience many things.

11:00.120 --> 11:02.850
And I was able to become the president of student organization as well.

11:03.220 --> 11:06.590
Arisada was a princess last year.

11:07.130 --> 11:11.400
Maybe you should learn more about the princess system and this school...

11:11.530 --> 11:14.830
...before you make up your mind.

11:36.520 --> 11:39.490
So you guys are showing director Ryuzaki around?

11:39.690 --> 11:43.560
President Arisada said he'd be with us for a while to observe some things.

11:43.670 --> 11:44.830
So he told us to be his guide.

11:45.030 --> 11:47.560
President Arisada was mad...

11:47.800 --> 11:51.530
Well, the director said the princess job the president once did was absurd.

11:51.640 --> 11:53.230
I was a bit angry too.

11:53.440 --> 11:55.340
Yeah, me too.

11:56.210 --> 12:00.150
I'm sure you want the princess system to be gone, Mikoto.

12:00.280 --> 12:02.550
You can be a normal guy again.

12:02.750 --> 12:04.180
I...

12:06.190 --> 12:10.560
I know this school needs the princesses.

12:10.760 --> 12:15.530
It's not that I don't want to do it, I just feel embarrassed...

12:16.330 --> 12:19.460
You won't like it if the princess system is gone, right, Kouno?

12:21.600 --> 12:26.040
You don't have to worry about me, but if the princesses were gone...

12:27.840 --> 12:30.070
The princesses are eating lunch together!

12:30.180 --> 12:32.510
Mr. Sakamoto is eating with them! How extravagant.

12:32.650 --> 12:35.170
I'm glad to be a student at this school!

12:36.150 --> 12:40.850
I feel like the energy being directed towards us is going to get out of control...

12:42.060 --> 12:43.550
It's very scary.

12:43.660 --> 12:45.250
You're right...

12:50.530 --> 12:53.300
This is the screening room, and this is the chem lab.

12:53.940 --> 12:58.170
They're both great facilities, and the students are happy with them.

12:58.310 --> 13:01.140
Kouno, you're a transfer student, right?

13:01.380 --> 13:02.170
Yes.

13:02.380 --> 13:03.640
You must've been surprised.

13:03.750 --> 13:05.770
They chose you to be a princess out of nowhere.

13:06.180 --> 13:07.740
Well...

13:08.550 --> 13:12.710
I agreed to their terms and accepted the job.

13:14.790 --> 13:16.760
What about you Shihoudani?

13:17.630 --> 13:21.590
It's not involuntary labor, and it's really a job worth doing.

13:21.760 --> 13:24.260
I really enjoy being a princess.

13:24.400 --> 13:25.830
What about you, Yutaka?

13:26.000 --> 13:29.600
I heard you don't like this princess job.

13:29.940 --> 13:31.500
I...

13:36.080 --> 13:38.480
I don't want the princess system to be gone.

13:39.010 --> 13:40.140
Really?

13:40.250 --> 13:42.220
Maybe you're just feeling the pressure.

13:42.320 --> 13:45.410
My job is to see that you can learn comfortably...

13:45.520 --> 13:49.390
...and create a place where your mind and body can grow as well.

13:50.120 --> 13:53.560
I want you to tell me if you have any complaints or concerns.

13:53.700 --> 13:54.420
Yes...

13:54.930 --> 14:00.840
He's really thinking about us, he's not a bad person.

14:01.540 --> 14:06.240
Ever since you started doing the princess job, your grades have been poor.

14:06.470 --> 14:09.270
Maybe this princess job is too much for you.

14:09.480 --> 14:11.500
That's not true.

14:32.970 --> 14:35.100
It must be tough for you guys...

14:35.270 --> 14:36.360
Yeah.

14:36.540 --> 14:38.600
He's not really a bad person.

14:38.710 --> 14:42.040
It's just that once he makes up his mind, then there's no stopping him.

14:42.340 --> 14:44.970
Are they going to get rid of the princess system?

14:45.410 --> 14:48.750
I'm sure president Arisada is coming up with a plan...

14:48.880 --> 14:52.080
Besides, the reason why
Mikoto's grades went down...

14:52.190 --> 14:57.250
...is because he was talking to his girlfriend everyday, right?

15:00.260 --> 15:01.850
Such a bum...

15:02.000 --> 15:04.360
He was absent-minded and didn't even do his homework.

15:04.530 --> 15:06.970
No wonder his grades went down!

15:07.200 --> 15:10.500
If they take away the princess system, then it's all your fault!

15:11.170 --> 15:13.140
No need to worry.

15:14.140 --> 15:17.600
Yutaka, we're going to help you with your studies.

15:17.780 --> 15:19.710
We'll teach you thoroughly.

15:19.850 --> 15:21.780
We'll help you until you can fully understand them.

15:22.180 --> 15:25.590
No, I was hoping Mr.
Sakamoto could teach me...

15:25.690 --> 15:27.990
Sure, I can help you if you want.

15:28.160 --> 15:29.420
No way.

15:29.560 --> 15:32.030
We can't let Mr. Sakamoto do that.

15:32.130 --> 15:36.000
Arisada said we're good enough to help you.

15:36.160 --> 15:38.330
Let's go, Yutaka.

15:38.670 --> 15:41.760
No!

15:42.370 --> 15:44.100
Well, it's all his fault...

15:44.210 --> 15:45.140
Yeah...

15:46.240 --> 15:48.640
<i>Home economics room</i>

15:52.550 --> 15:54.210
Your lace is crooked!

15:54.350 --> 15:55.580
If you tie this...

15:55.680 --> 15:57.080
This is also coming loose!

15:57.190 --> 16:00.020
Um, Natasho, the guests are waiting...

16:00.120 --> 16:02.060
I don't care about that!

16:02.290 --> 16:03.990
This lace is also crooked.

16:04.130 --> 16:06.530
Wait a minute, it might look good if it's crooked...

16:07.460 --> 16:11.260
Natasho is in charge of the wardrobes for princesses.

16:11.500 --> 16:13.020
He's a really good designer.

16:13.170 --> 16:16.730
He won the grand prize this year at the all-Japan high school designing contest.

16:17.070 --> 16:20.840
He has a lot of talent, but ever since he took charge of their wardrobe designs...

16:20.980 --> 16:23.040
...his talent has gotten even greater.

16:23.540 --> 16:29.350
When he plans their wardrobes, he has a lot of wonderful inspiration.

16:29.480 --> 16:31.980
Hands here! Stand up straight!

16:32.090 --> 16:35.150
I need you to be high-spirited!

16:33.890 --> 16:35.150
<i>President Arisada?</i>

16:35.520 --> 16:37.960
I'm following you guys around today.

16:41.900 --> 16:43.730
Good luck you guys!

16:43.870 --> 16:44.960
Yeah!

16:53.210 --> 16:54.940
Princesses! Thanks for your service.

16:56.740 --> 16:57.510
Good luck!

16:58.110 --> 17:03.140
The students accept their presence in a natural way...

17:03.250 --> 17:06.480
The princesses are here since they're needed.

17:06.920 --> 17:09.910
Their smile gives everyone hope.

17:14.730 --> 17:15.790
What's wrong?

17:16.400 --> 17:18.130
What the hell?

17:18.300 --> 17:18.860
Oh no!

17:24.410 --> 17:26.030
What? Say that again!

17:26.270 --> 17:27.970
Can't you see we're practicing?

17:28.140 --> 17:29.610
Everyone!

17:30.480 --> 17:32.000
What are you doing?

17:32.610 --> 17:34.550
You shouldn't fight.

17:34.650 --> 17:38.210
Well, we were just arguing about the use of this field...

17:38.620 --> 17:41.610
Then how about checking the schedule for the usage of the field...

17:41.760 --> 17:44.190
...over at the student organization room?

17:44.790 --> 17:46.730
And if you're still not satisfied...

17:46.830 --> 17:49.130
...why not bring this matter to the student organization?

17:49.630 --> 17:54.000
If you fight and get injured, you won't be able to play in the actual game.

17:56.940 --> 17:58.570
You're right.

17:58.970 --> 18:00.240
I got a little out of control.

18:00.410 --> 18:03.040
Yeah, we should've done that from the very beginning.

18:07.210 --> 18:11.020
They're like a lubricating oil that soothes peoples' hearts.

18:11.120 --> 18:12.680
Like an oasis.

18:12.850 --> 18:17.090
They too are trying their best to do their jobs.

18:17.260 --> 18:18.920
Good luck with practice!

18:19.030 --> 18:21.430
Good luck!

18:30.870 --> 18:33.570
Do you guys like this school?

18:36.580 --> 18:37.240
Yes.

18:37.240 --> 18:37.770
I like it.

18:38.450 --> 18:39.640
I see.

18:56.630 --> 18:59.120
Are you still alive, Mikoto?

19:00.100 --> 19:03.400
The formulas I memorized are going to leak from my head!

19:03.500 --> 19:05.630
I'm guessing it was a Spartan training.

19:05.770 --> 19:08.140
Well, if you don't want any more of this...

19:08.240 --> 19:11.440
I suggest you start studying more and talk less to your girlfriend.

19:11.850 --> 19:13.280
I know...

19:13.510 --> 19:16.280
By the way, what happened with director Ryuzaki?

19:16.380 --> 19:17.150
I don't know.

19:17.250 --> 19:19.450
He said he's holding a board meeting sometime soon...

19:20.860 --> 19:22.590
First, I'd like to say...

19:22.690 --> 19:27.250
...that the new director who took over for his father...

19:27.430 --> 19:30.870
...Kazushi Ryuzaki, is here with us for the very first time.

19:31.400 --> 19:34.160
I'm still young and inexperienced, but nice to meet you all.

19:34.400 --> 19:37.370
I heard you went to observe one of the schools.

19:37.540 --> 19:41.270
Well Ryuzaki, what did you think of the Fujimori Academy?

19:41.540 --> 19:42.600
Yes.

19:42.840 --> 19:44.710
I was really surprised.

19:44.950 --> 19:47.540
Ah, so you met those princesses.

19:47.720 --> 19:49.380
Aren't they cute?

19:50.620 --> 19:54.420
The place becomes spectacular when they're around.

19:54.660 --> 19:57.450
And all the princesses this year are wonderful.

19:57.590 --> 20:00.790
There's a photo of them with their new outfits in this report.

20:00.900 --> 20:03.090
Let me see... Amazing!

20:03.260 --> 20:08.170
Photos look good, but I really want to meet them in person!

20:08.270 --> 20:12.170
Because of them, Fujimori
Academy is peaceful and secure.

20:12.340 --> 20:14.310
Excuse me, but how is that...

20:14.540 --> 20:18.670
It's strange, but the ones who were once princesses became talented people.

20:18.810 --> 20:21.540
And that goes for the students as well.

20:21.750 --> 20:24.650
Our school will be famous.

20:24.750 --> 20:28.710
As a matter of fact, most of us members were once princesses too.

20:33.030 --> 20:36.730
Our previous director was also a princess.

20:53.550 --> 20:58.450
Because of you guys, the board of directors drastically raised our princess budget.

20:58.690 --> 20:59.180
Huh?

20:59.290 --> 21:01.260
Princess budget?

21:02.360 --> 21:05.120
After director Ryuzaki saw you guys in action...

21:05.290 --> 21:08.420
...he realized that this school needs princesses.

21:08.660 --> 21:11.260
And he talked it over at the board meeting.

21:11.630 --> 21:12.960
Does that mean...

21:13.070 --> 21:14.900
You were planning that from the very beginning...

21:15.200 --> 21:17.830
...and forced director Ryuzaki onto us?

21:18.370 --> 21:22.810
The board of directors expects many great things from you guys.

21:22.980 --> 21:26.000
Great! Now we can create bigger events in the future!

21:26.610 --> 21:28.410
We're no match for him...

21:28.550 --> 21:29.610
Yeah...

21:29.720 --> 21:30.950
You're right...

21:41.730 --> 21:49.300
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.400 --> 21:57.470
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:57.980 --> 22:05.320
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.420 --> 22:13.160
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.290 --> 22:23.290
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.540 --> 22:30.140
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.480 --> 22:31.970
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.110 --> 22:39.850
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:39.950 --> 22:45.950
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.090 --> 22:48.120
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.400 --> 22:58.390
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:04.950 --> 23:09.910
Next Episode, The School Festival Begins
